# 🏦 Bank Transaction Analytics Report

## 📊 Project Overview
This report summarizes insights generated from SQL queries on the **BankDB** dataset.  
The goal is to answer business questions, highlight key performance indicators (KPIs), and detect fraud or risk patterns across branches, customers, and transactions.

---

